# No environment variables are required to run or build the demo.
#
# Deployment (Cloudflare Pages) uses the Wrangler CLI. Locally, `wrangler login`
# provides credentials; in GitHub Actions the Deploy workflow reads two repository
# secrets (never commit their values):
#   CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN   token with Cloudflare Pages edit permission
#   CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID  the Cloudflare account that owns the Pages project
